              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Gemini RAG: fill GEMINI_API_KEY in server .env and restart API. Send only Farmer JWT and question here. Never paste the Gemini key into Postman. Missing key:503/no history write; quota:429; success:201 with citations."
      },
